# Supabase CLI scratch state (link metadata, pooler URLs — machine-local)
supabase/.temp/

# Event photography staged for upload.
#
# Photographs never belong in git. They are children's images, and the consent
# gate that protects them (`media.consent_verified`, enforced by a database
# trigger) only exists once they are in the media library — a copy in the repo
# is a copy outside that protection, permanently, in every clone and in the
# history. Upload them through the CMS and delete the local archives.
/Gallery/
